    "name": "Rancher Management Clusters API",
    "description": "The Rancher Management API exposes Rancher's multi-cluster Kubernetes management capabilities as Kubernetes-style REST resources. It enables automation of cluster lifecycle, project and namespace management, user and group access control, catalog and app management, and integration of Rancher into CI/CD and platform engineering workflows. The API is reached through the Rancher server URL and authenticated with bearer tokens generated from the Rancher UI or via the login endpoint.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Rancher Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-22T02:35:39.000Z",
